      {
        "id": "sift-motivation",
        "moduleId": "problem-and-scale",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "为什么需要 SIFT",
        "markdown": "Harris 等角点检测器具有旋转不变性：图像旋转后角点仍是角点。但它不具备尺度不变性——在小图中落在小窗口内的角点，放大后在同一窗口内会变得平坦。SIFT 由 D. Lowe 于 2004 年在论文《Distinctive Image Features from Scale-Invariant Keypoints》中提出，用于提取对尺度变化稳定的关键点并计算描述子。原始论文把算法分为四个主要步骤。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000085"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Introduction to SIFT (Scale-Invariant Feature Transform)",
                "Theory"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1541,
              "lineEnd": 1558,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_feature2d/py_sift_intro/images/sift_scale_invariant.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "009a34742c0a1694c9ae9f2a3789d37406d1422b38287940da24f5f593da8973"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "sift-window-intuition",
        "moduleId": "problem-and-scale",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "用窗口大小理解尺度（模型补充）",
        "markdown": "可以把尺度想成观察用的放大镜：小窗口适合看细节，大窗口适合看整体结构。固定窗口只能在某一尺度上判断“像不像角点”，所以 SIFT 不再固定窗口，而是在多个尺度上同时寻找稳定的极值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "sift-motivation"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scale-space-log",
        "moduleId": "dog-extrema",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "尺度空间与高斯拉普拉斯",
        "markdown": "为了在不同尺度上检测关键点，SIFT 使用尺度空间滤波：对图像用不同 $\\sigma$ 的高斯核做平滑，并计算高斯拉普拉斯（LoG）。$\\sigma$ 相当于尺度参数：较小的 $\\sigma$ 对小结构响应强，较大的 $\\sigma$ 适合检测更大的结构。LoG 因此可以充当斑点检测器。在尺度与空间两个维度上寻找局部极大值，就得到一组 $(x, y, \\sigma)$，表示在 $(x, y)$ 处、尺度为 $\\sigma$ 可能存在一个关键点。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000086"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Introduction to SIFT (Scale-Invariant Feature Transform)",
                "Theory",
                "Scale-space Extrema Detection"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1559,
              "lineEnd": 1588,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_feature2d/py_sift_intro/images/sift_dog.jpg",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_feature2d/py_sift_intro/images/sift_local_extrema.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "6f967c71d38489afcafe11868978f62e2f8f5fae9d73def9847431b97019c682"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "dog-and-extrema",
        "moduleId": "dog-extrema",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "高斯差分与跨尺度极值检测",
        "markdown": "直接计算 LoG 代价较高，SIFT 改用高斯差分（Difference of Gaussians, DoG）近似 LoG。DoG 由同一图像在两个相邻尺度 $\\sigma$ 与 $k\\sigma$ 上的高斯模糊结果相减得到，并在高斯金字塔的不同 octave（八度）上重复。得到 DoG 金字塔后，对每个像素与同尺度的 8 个邻居、上一尺度的 9 个像素和下一尺度的 9 个像素比较；若它是局部极值，就作为候选关键点。论文给出的经验参数包括 octave 数 4、每个 octave 的尺度层数 5、初始 $\\sigma = 1.6$、$k = \\sqrt{2}$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000086"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Introduction to SIFT (Scale-Invariant Feature Transform)",
                "Theory",
                "Scale-space Extrema Detection"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1559,
              "lineEnd": 1588,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_feature2d/py_sift_intro/images/sift_dog.jpg",
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_feature2d/py_sift_intro/images/sift_local_extrema.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "6f967c71d38489afcafe11868978f62e2f8f5fae9d73def9847431b97019c682"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "dog-formula",
        "moduleId": "dog-extrema",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "DoG 的差分形式（模型补充）",
        "markdown": "用 $L(x, y, \\sigma)$ 表示尺度 $\\sigma$ 下的高斯平滑图像，DoG 可以写成相邻两层的差：\n\n$$D(x, y, \\sigma) = L(x, y, k\\sigma) - L(x, y, \\sigma).$$\n\n比较 26 个邻域像素，本质上是在 $(x, y, \\sigma)$ 三维空间里找局部极大或极小，因此候选点天然带有尺度标签。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "dog-and-extrema"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "keypoint-refine",
        "moduleId": "localization",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "极值精确定位与低对比度剔除",
        "markdown": "候选极值的位置还需要细化。SIFT 对尺度空间做泰勒展开，求出更精确的极值位置；如果该极值处的强度低于阈值，就把它剔除。论文采用的阈值是 0.03，在 OpenCV 中对应 contrastThreshold。这样可去掉对噪声敏感的低对比度候选点。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000087"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Introduction to SIFT (Scale-Invariant Feature Transform)",
                "Theory",
                "Keypoint Localization"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1589,
              "lineEnd": 1606,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0b870d9aceac32e0ef57b82f11e85d40fb5d5c8d40c935f73c30994d4bf1a330"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "edge-rejection",
        "moduleId": "localization",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "边缘响应剔除",
        "markdown": "DoG 对边缘也有较强响应，因此还要去掉落在边缘上的候选点。做法与 Harris 角点检测类似：用 $2\\times2$ 的 Hessian 矩阵 $H$ 计算主曲率。边缘处一个特征值明显大于另一个；当两者的比值超过阈值时丢弃该关键点。论文给出的比值为 10，在 OpenCV 中对应 edgeThreshold。经过这两步，剩下的是低对比度与边缘响应都被排除的强兴趣点。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000087"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Introduction to SIFT (Scale-Invariant Feature Transform)",
                "Theory",
                "Keypoint Localization"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1589,
              "lineEnd": 1606,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0b870d9aceac32e0ef57b82f11e85d40fb5d5c8d40c935f73c30994d4bf1a330"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "edge-rejection-intuition",
        "moduleId": "localization",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "为什么边缘点不稳定（模型补充）",
        "markdown": "边缘上的点在沿边缘方向移动时响应几乎不变，位置因此不确定；而真正的角点在两个方向都有明显变化。Hessian 两个特征值的差距正好刻画这种各向异性，所以用特征值比值就能筛掉边缘点。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "edge-rejection"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "orientation-assignment",
        "moduleId": "orientation-descriptor",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "方向分配",
        "markdown": "为获得旋转不变性，SIFT 给每个关键点分配一个主方向。以关键点为中心、按尺度取邻域，计算该区域内每个像素的梯度幅值和方向；把 360° 划分为 36 个 bin，用梯度幅值加权，并用 $\\sigma$ 为关键点尺度 1.5 倍的高斯圆形窗口平滑，形成方向直方图。直方图的最高峰作为主方向；任何达到最高峰 80% 以上的峰也会被保留，从而在同一位置、同一尺度上产生多个不同方向的关键点。这有助于提高匹配的稳定性。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000088"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Introduction to SIFT (Scale-Invariant Feature Transform)",
                "Theory",
                "Orientation Assignment"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1607,
              "lineEnd": 1616,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "f8ef0f3c8ec7f87ebe0fd7116a16308603bb252e97b3e56e843dc0913a355257"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "orientation-rotation",
        "moduleId": "orientation-descriptor",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "主方向如何带来旋转不变性（模型补充）",
        "markdown": "如果把每个关键点的邻域按主方向旋转对齐，那么图像整体旋转就等价于各邻域内梯度方向的整体偏移。先减去主方向，描述子看到的相对方向就基本不变，旋转不变性由此而来。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "orientation-assignment"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "keypoint-descriptor",
        "moduleId": "orientation-descriptor",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "128 维关键点描述子",
        "markdown": "描述子在关键点周围取 $16\\times16$ 的邻域，划分成 $4\\times4$ 的 16 个子块。每个子块统计 8 个方向的梯度直方图，因此共有 $16\\times8 = 128$ 个 bin 值，按顺序排成一个向量，就是关键点描述子。此外还会采取若干措施提升对光照变化、旋转等的鲁棒性。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000089"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Introduction to SIFT (Scale-Invariant Feature Transform)",
                "Theory",
                "Keypoint Descriptor"
              ],
