      {
        "id": "opencv-sift-code",
        "moduleId": "matching-and-opencv",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "检测关键点并计算描述子",
        "markdown": "已有关键点时可以调用 sift.compute() 计算描述子；也可以直接一步完成检测和计算：\n\n```python\nimport cv2 as cv\n\nimg = cv.imread('home.jpg')\ngray = cv.cvtColor(img, cv.COLOR_BGR2GRAY)\n\nsift = cv.SIFT_create()\nkp, des = sift.detectAndCompute(gray, None)\n```\n\n其中 kp 是关键点列表，des 是形状为（关键点数量）× 128 的 NumPy 数组。",
        "provenance": {
